Description: Extracts column-level lineage from 'dplyr' and 'dbplyr'
    pipelines and from SQL queries, and renders it as an interactive
    'React Flow' diagram. The same lineage is available as plain data
    for impact analysis, for comparing pipeline versions (including a
    continuous-integration check that fails on breaking provenance
    changes), and for export to JSON, 'GraphML', 'Mermaid', and
    'OpenLineage' interchange formats.
